      "role": "user",
      "content": "ionization-induced perceptual effects? i've never even heard of that term. so you're saying it's actually a physical thing and not just my brain misfiring? because i've been seeing these blue streaks right before i get lucky with things, like finding money or a certain person walking through a door at the exact right time. it feels so much more like i'm seeing the \"path\" of what's about to happen rather than just seeing colors. do you think the particle stream could have basically rewired my sensory input to track quantum fluctuations or something like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
